      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To prepare a strong defense for your IP portfolio, focus on highlighting the quality and breadth of your patents, as well as any recent developments or extensions. Emphasize the strategic importance of these IP assets in driving business growth and profitability. You may also want to stress the value of your IP in maintaining a competitive edge and preventing infringement. This can help justify the valuation and demonstrate the financial importance of your patents.",
